+## `--cache-location`
+
+Path to the cache file. Relative paths are resolved from the current working directory. If not specified, Prettier uses `node_modules/.cache/prettier/.prettier-cache`.
+
+```bash
+prettier --write --cache --cache-location .cache/prettier-cache src
+```
+
 ## `--cache-strategy`
 
 Strategy for the cache to use for detecting changed files. Can be either `metadata` or `content`.
